ives the following:\n\n| $\\,x\\,$ | $\\,y\\,$ | $\\,{y}^{′}\\,$ | $\\,Δy\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $1$ | $2$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| $3$ | $4$ | $$ | $$ |\n\nNext, we compute ${y}^{′}$ according to the given rule (using the values of $x$ and $y$ in the second row), and we compute \n$Δy$ using Euler's method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′} & =\\frac{x{y}^{2}}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cdot {4}^{2}}{4} \\\\  & =12 \\\\ Δy & ={y}^{′}\\cdot Δx \\\\  & =12\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =24\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe add this to our table.\n\n| $\\,x\\,$ | $\\,y\\,$ | $\\,{y}^{′}\\,$ | $\\,Δy\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $1$ | $2$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| $3$ | $4$ | $12$ | $24$ |" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313816 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313817 13194139534840 true] [17592186313816 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313818 13194139534840 true] [17592186313816 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313819 13194139534840 true] [17592186313816 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313820 13194139534840 true] [17592186313816 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313821 13194139534840 true] [17592186313816 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534840 true] [17592186313816 1041 "selection" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313816 1104 #edb/ref 17592186313821 13194139534840 true] [17592186313816 1110 #uuid "634b61cc-041c-5c4c-a19e-e95d278a5cf8" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313817 1034 "12" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313817 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534840 true] [17592186313817 1111 #uuid "36819efe-53f1-5361-90d9-402c1c19d622" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313818 1034 "2" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313818 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534840 true] [17592186313818 1111 #uuid "c0226456-8ba8-5fdf-8c25-82622d1c74b5" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313819 1034 "6" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313819 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534840 true] [17592186313819 1111 #uuid "b2fe6b7f-9b0c-5393-b012-a91d6aada416" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313820 1034 "4" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313820 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534840 true]