.\n\n| $\\,x\\,$ | $\\,y\\,$ | $\\,{y}^{′}\\,$ | $\\,Δy\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $2$ | $e$ | $8$ | $4$ |\n| $\\frac{5}{2}$ | $e+4$ | $10\\operatorname{ln}⁡(e+4)$ | $5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(e+4)$ |" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313823 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313824 13194139534840 true] [17592186313823 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313825 13194139534840 true] [17592186313823 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313826 13194139534840 true] [17592186313823 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313827 13194139534840 true] [17592186313823 1000 #edb/ref 17592186313828 13194139534840 true] [17592186313823 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534840 true] [17592186313823 1041 "selection" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313823 1104 #edb/ref 17592186313826 13194139534840 true] [17592186313823 1110 #uuid "1662cab7-77c7-57e3-a4bd-2de2b3e9f5d9" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313824 1034 "10(e+4)" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313824 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534840 true] [17592186313824 1111 #uuid "22e46038-34a7-5c27-bbb7-6008335450f3" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313825 1034 "10\\operatorname{ln}⁡(e+4)" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313825 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534840 true] [17592186313825 1111 #uuid "b72ed886-d81e-5c2d-a79e-de3bd13835a5" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313826 1034 "5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(e+4)" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313826 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534840 true] [17592186313826 1111 #uuid "b2d67b05-0a9a-5fa5-b645-773ff1ba92ea" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313827 1034 "5(e+4)" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313827 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534840 true] [17592186313827 1111 #uuid "cbcdfa00-091f-5a68-a5d8-3105e9882e78" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313828 1034 "e+4" 13194139534840 true] [17592186313828 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534840 true] [17592186313828 1111 #uuid "2b49a550-4f7b-54e6-b763-69ba57cbdca1" 13194139534840 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-117941" 17592186313761 "q-117941/selection" 17592186313762 "q-117941/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4